# Source files in this repo are stored with CRLF, matching main.
# `-text` stops Git from normalizing them to LF on check-in, which would
# rewrite every line and hide real edits. `diff` keeps the review as text.
*.html -text diff
*.css  -text diff
*.js   -text diff
*.py   -text diff
*.md   -text diff
*.yml  -text diff
*.yaml -text diff
*.ogg  binary
